If there were a sink somewhere reachable, this game would be
salvageable.  It is pretty likely there was one in the explored part of
the dungeon, but you blew it by going to level 1. :P

The prayer might have succeeded had you waited longer with it.  If you
could still kill monsters, your luck cannot have been that bad, so
waiting several hundreds of turns might have helped (luck expires one
point per 600 turns, or 300 if your god is angry or you have killed the
wiz or performed the invocation).  Prayer with negative luck, however,
does not anger your god, unless it was also too early.  It does add a
new prayer timeout though.

So move to the upstairs of DL 1 and wait until you're fainting, then
pray.  If your god is angry again, escape the dungeon.

